 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 7.68,
   "text": "Hi, I'm John. For the past two years, I ran a social experiment where I went on dates with over 100 women and documented everything I learned."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.18,
   "e": 20.82,
   "text": "My goal wasn't just to date, it was to understand how attraction works, how people choose a partner, what creates chemistry, how to recognize red flags, what to say, what not to say, how to carry yourself, and when it's time to stay or walk away."
  },
  {
   "s": 20.82,
   "e": 26.3,
   "text": "After all those experiences, I realize there isn't a single place where guys can get honest,"
  },
  {
   "s": 26.48,
   "e": 33.0,
   "text": "practical dating advice without all the fake, alpha nonsense. So that's why I created this channel."
  },
  {
   "s": 33.62,
   "e": 39.1,
   "text": "Everything I share comes from real life experience, the wins, the mistakes, the awkward moments,"
  },
  {
   "s": 39.48,
   "e": 43.8,
   "text": "and the lessons I learned along the way. My goal is simple, help you become more confident,"
  },
  {
   "s": 44.28,
   "e": 49.08,
   "text": "avoid common dating mistakes, and build healthier relationships. I'm also writing a book that goes"
  },
  {
   "s": 49.08,
   "e": 53.72,
   "text": "even deeper. So stay tuned for that. If you're ready to level up your dating life,"
  },
  {
   "s": 54.02,
   "e": 57.68,
   "text": "hit that like button, subscribe, and join the bros. I've got you."
  }
 ]
}